;--------------------------------------------------------------------
;Screener Import Auto-Fill
;--------------------------------------------------------------------
; This feature auto-fills the screener import popup with your password and server and puts you in the job number entry field.
; This will only work if you have already initiated the import and received the dialogue box that asks for server, user, password and job number.
+F1::
Send {TAB 2}
Send internal.e-rewards.com
Send {TAB}
Send %JobClip%
Send {TAB 2}
Return